  "goodToKnow": "Die Tilgung is the repayment of a debt or loan. A typical German mortgage rate (die Annuität) combines Zins (interest) and Tilgung; buyers often choose an initial Tilgung of two to three percent a year and may make Sondertilgungen (extra repayments). Tilgen also means to erase: Spuren tilgen, and entries in criminal records are getilgt after a set time. Plural: die Tilgungen."
